What you'll want to do is
create a folder named "www" in your Shiny App folder (the folder where your ui.R and server.R files reside)
save the file as "plot.png" or whatever you want to name it
change the tags$img to tags$img(src="plot.png", height="200px")
you don't need to put "www/plot.png" because it automatically looks in the www folder

