Hi! Something like this:

ProxyPass /app/ http://localhost:3838/app/
ProxyPassReverse /app/ http://localhost:3838/app/
RedirectMatch permanent ^/app$ /app/

with

site.com/app/ <http://site.com/app/>

works for me. (Note the / at the end.)

Cheers, L

