You won't be able to avoid writing JS code.

You'll need to include Jmol.js to your shiny app with tags$script and write some sort of initializer that'll include the applet to your page using jmol.js API <http://jmol.sourceforge.net/jslibrary/> and receives data from R.

I suggest starting with Dashboard example <https://groups.google.com/forum/#!searchin/shiny-discuss/gridster/shiny-discuss/3-1xttV8k3c/V1SY2KZwIboJ>.

Good luck.

